p Nitrous software engineers are responsible for driving the user experience and performance of our web and desktop applications.

p We're looking for motivated, independent thinkers who employ creative, scalable and performant solutions.

h3 Responsibilities

ul
  li Build new features in Go and React
  li Benchmark app performance and design scalable and performant systems and APIs

h3 Technologies

ul
  li Go, Ruby
  li Docker
  li React, JavaScript (ES6)
  li PostgreSQL, Redis, Memcache
  li Websockets
  li Amazon Web Services
  li RabbitMQ, AMQP
  li Git

h3 Requirements

ul
  li A passion for cloud computing and optimization
  li Obsessive attention to detail
  li Risk taker, not afraid to break things to push the envelope of what's possible
  li Degree in Computer Science or related technical field

p To apply, please provide the following:

ul
  li Resume
  li Github Profile
  li Links to side/hobby projects that you have built

